<view class="scan-page"><view class="scan-box"><view class="scan-line"></view></view><view class="scan-title">扫描充电桩二维码</view><view class="scan-desc">支持 zxkcharge://pile/桩编号/枪号，也支持直接识别14位桩编号。</view><button class="scan-btn" bindtap="scan">开始扫码</button><view wx:if="{{pileCode}}" class="result">已识别：{{pileCode}} / 枪 {{gunNo}}</view><button wx:if="{{pileCode}}" class="scan-btn" bindtap="goCharge">进入充电页面</button><view wx:if="{{result}}" class="result">原始内容：{{result}}</view></view>
